ELIMINATED JUST GOES TO SHOW ME

24
00:01:32,059 --> 00:01:35,829
THAT THE TABLES CAN TURN
ANYTIME DURING THIS COMPETITION.

25
00:01:35,829 --> 00:01:37,397
I REALLY THOUGHT THAT CATIE
HAD WHAT IT TAKES

26
00:01:37,397 --> 00:01:38,899
TO BE A TOP MODEL.

27
00:01:38,899 --> 00:01:40,467
Camille: I'VE CHANGED.

28
00:01:40,467 --> 00:01:43,971
I'VE MADE AN EFFORT
