29
00:01:43,971 --> 00:01:46,573
ALL I CAN DO IS BE ME--

30
00:01:46,573 --> 00:01:48,642
IS BE ME 100%.

31
00:01:48,642 --> 00:01:49,876
♪♪♪

32
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,514
(phone beeps)
Shandi: HELLO?

33
00:01:54,514 --> 00:01:56,516
