Shandi: HI, BABY.

34
00:01:56,516 --> 00:01:57,918
Eric: How are you doing?
Shandi: GOOD.

35
00:01:57,918 --> 00:01:59,386
Eric: Good.

36
00:01:59,386 --> 00:02:00,921
Shandi: I'M WEARING
YOUR DRESS THAT YOU GAVE ME.

37
00:02:00,921 --> 00:02:01,888
Eric: What did you say?

38
00:02:01,888 --> 00:02:03,390
Shandi: I'M WEARING
YOUR DRESS.

39
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:04,558
Eric: You mean the, um...

40
00:02:04,558 --> 00:02:05,759
Shandi: THE ONE YOU BOUGHT ME
FOR MY BIRTHDAY.

41
00:02:05,759 --> 00:02:08,729
Eric: Yay! Really?
Shandi: MM-HMM.

42
