Shandi: AW.

56
00:02:41,061 --> 00:02:42,763
Sara: I'VE ALWAYS TAKEN
THE SAFE ROUTE.

57
00:02:42,763 --> 00:02:44,831
I'VE ALWAYS QUIT THE JOBS
THAT INTIMIDATED ME,

58
00:02:44,831 --> 00:02:46,967
AND EVEN THOUGH I'VE BEEN
LIKE THAT IN MY LIFE,

59
00:02:46,967 --> 00:02:51,571
KIND OF TAKEN THE SAFE WAY,
I HAVE SO MUCH STRENGTH IN ME,

60
00:02:51,571 --> 00:02:54,141
AND I THINK THAT'S WHY
I WANTED THIS SO BADLY--

61
00:02:54,141 --> 00:02:56,576
BECAUSE I KNOW I CAN DO IT.

62
00:02:56,576 --> 00:02:58,912
I WOULD LOVE TO BE
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

63
00:02:58,912 --> 00:03:01,381
I DON'T THINK ANYBODY
WANTS THIS AS BADLY AS I DO.

64
00:03:01,381 --> 00:03:03,150
♪♪♪

65
00:03:23,670 --> 00:03:25,372
Yoanna: I REALLY HAVE
A PASSION FOR THIS.

66
00:03:25,372 --> 00:03:26,406
THIS IS SOMETHING
I'VE ALWAYS WANTED

67
00:03:26,406 --> 00:03:27,641
SINCE I WAS A LITTLE GIRL.

68
00:03:27,641 --> 00:03:29,643
I WANT IT SO BAD,
SO I'M GONNA MAKE SURE

69
00:03:29,643 --> 00:03:31,445
THAT I, LIKE, PUT THAT OUT
IN THE UNIVERSE.

70
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:38,618
SO IF YOU HAD A CHOICE
TO BE AN ACTRESS OR A MODEL,

71
00:03:38,618 --> 00:03:41,421
WHAT WOULD YOU CHOOSE,
LIKE, RIGHT NOW?

72
00:03:41,421 --> 00:03:43,724
