MODELING AS ACTING.

73
00:03:43,724 --> 00:03:46,026
I VIEW MODELING
AS THE BASE OF ACTING.

74
00:03:46,026 --> 00:03:49,496
THIS IS MY FIRST
MODELING EXPERIENCE EVER.

75
00:03:49,496 --> 00:03:51,932
I'VE BEEN TOLD BY ENOUGH PEOPLE
THAT YES, YOU CAN BE A MODEL,

76
00:03:51,932 --> 00:03:54,367
