ON MYSELF IF I WANT

77
00:03:54,367 --> 00:03:56,002
TO WIN THIS THING,
BUT I THINK I CAN

78
00:03:56,002 --> 00:03:57,604
IF I TRY REALLY HARD.

79
00:03:57,604 --> 00:03:58,972
I'VE NEVER BEEN
IN EITHER SITUATION,

80
00:03:58,972 --> 00:04:00,474
SO, LIKE, I REALLY--

81
00:04:00,474 --> 00:04:01,608
IT'S TOO EARLY FOR ME TO SAY.

82
00:04:01,608 --> 00:04:02,676
Yoanna: RIGHT.

83
00:04:02,676 --> 00:04:03,944
