ABOUT BEING

86
00:04:07,781 --> 00:04:09,382
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL?

87
00:04:09,382 --> 00:04:11,051
BECAUSE SHE DOESN'T GIVE A DAMN
ABOUT FASHION

88
00:04:11,051 --> 00:04:12,385
OR ANYTHING LIKE THAT.

89
00:04:12,385 --> 00:04:13,720
