I WOULD BE DEVASTATED.

91
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:17,491
SO WHAT'S YOUR GOAL
RIGHT NOW?

92
00:04:17,491 --> 00:04:18,558
April: TO WIN THIS CONTEST.

93
00:04:20,494 --> 00:04:21,762
♪♪♪

94
00:04:23,029 --> 00:04:24,631
Yoanna: TYRA MAIL!

95
00:04:24,631 --> 00:04:26,767
Sara: WE GET TYRA MAIL,
