98
00:04:30,403 --> 00:04:31,872
IT'S A DANCE STUDIO.

99
00:04:33,373 --> 00:04:34,541
Mercedes: OH,
WE'RE GONNA BE DANCING!

100
00:04:34,541 --> 00:04:36,476
LATIN! I CAN'T WAIT. OH!

101
00:04:36,476 --> 00:04:38,445
I TURNED TO SHANDI,
AND SHE'S, LIKE, "OH, GOD.

102
00:04:38,445 --> 00:04:40,514
I--I HOPE IT'S NOT THIS."

103
00:04:41,882 --> 00:04:43,617
Tony: WHAT'S UP, LADIES?
Camille: HI.

104
00:04:43,617 --> 00:04:44,618
Tony: COME ON IN.

105
00:04:44,618 --> 00:04:45,619
I'M TONY MICHAELS.

106
00:04:45,619 --> 00:04:46,720
I'M A CHOREOGRAPHER.

107
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,721
I'VE WORKED WITH J. LO.

108
00:04:47,721 --> 00:04:48,989
I'VE WORKED WITH
CELINE DION.

109
00:04:48,989 --> 00:04:50,056
I'VE WORKED WITH PRINCE.

110
00:04:50,056 --> 00:04:50,991
