NOTHIN' OUT OF YOU.

136
00:05:49,115 --> 00:05:50,784
Sara: ALL RIGHT.

137
00:05:50,784 --> 00:05:52,152
Tony: ALL OF THIS,
ALL OF THAT, IT WAS NOTHING

138
00:05:52,152 --> 00:05:53,753
