BUT IT WAS INTERESTING.

142
00:06:11,504 --> 00:06:12,973
Tony: SENSUAL.

143
00:06:12,973 --> 00:06:14,507
TAKE YOUR TIME. TAKE YOUR TIME.

144
00:06:14,507 --> 00:06:16,476
CATCH THE BEAT.
CATCH THE BEAT.

145
00:06:16,476 --> 00:06:18,044
Mercedes: YOANNA'S DANCING
FITS HER CHARACTER.

146
00:06:18,044 --> 00:06:19,613
