YOU SEE, "WOW. SHE'S GOT IT."

151
00:06:37,597 --> 00:06:39,165
Yoanna: I'M SURPRISED
TO SEE SHANDI MOVE SO WELL,

152
00:06:39,165 --> 00:06:41,101
