TO DANCE SEXY.

155
00:06:44,437 --> 00:06:45,839
BE SEXY.

156
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:48,108
I'M THE MALE MODEL, OKAY?

157
00:06:48,108 --> 00:06:49,709
I WANT YOU TO WORK AROUND ME.

158
00:06:49,709 --> 00:06:50,844
YOU'RE FIRST.

159
00:06:50,844 --> 00:06:52,479
