MORE THAN ME.

163
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:04,824
Mercedes: WE HAD TO, LIKE,
DANCE AROUND HIM,

164
00:07:04,824 --> 00:07:06,726
USE HIM AS, LIKE,
IF WE WERE IN A PHOTO SHOOT.

165
00:07:06,726 --> 00:07:07,460
♪ WHOA ♪

166
00:07:08,895 --> 00:07:10,030
♪ WHOA ♪

167
