I THINK THAT I'M SEXY?

185
00:07:54,641 --> 00:07:55,842
♪♪♪

186
00:07:59,012 --> 00:08:00,547
Shandi: I GOT SOMETHIN'.

187
00:08:00,547 --> 00:08:01,614
Mercedes: YOU GOT SOMETHIN'?

188
00:08:01,614 --> 00:08:02,916
Shandi: (laughing)

189
00:08:05,452 --> 00:08:07,821
WHEN I GET THE PACKAGE
FROM MY BOYFRIEND, IT'S--

190
00:08:07,821 --> 00:08:10,090
