A PIECE OF HOME WITH ME.

191
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:11,925
I HAVE A PIECE OF MY BOYFRIEND.

192
00:08:11,925 --> 00:08:13,526
OH, HE DID HIS FACE.

193
00:08:13,526 --> 00:08:15,161
HE DID HIS MODEL FACE.

194
00:08:15,161 --> 00:08:16,596
Mercedes: OH, THAT'S GOOD.

195
00:08:16,596 --> 00:08:18,665
THAT'S SO "ZOOLANDER"
RIGHT THERE.

196
00:08:18,665 --> 00:08:20,133
Shandi: I JUST FEEL,
LIKE, REALLY LOVED

197
